# Workspace Conventions

This page records **evolving project- and user-specific conventions** for this wiki.
Keep the stable schema and generic workflows in `CLAUDE.md` (or in
`llm-wiki-instructions/CLAUDE.md` if you import it); keep durable workspace
preferences here so other agents can pick them up in later sessions.

## Writing conventions

- Use plain technical prose.
- Avoid AI-style emphasis and unjustified adjectives such as "key", "critical", "central", "core", "important", "major", "genuine", or "novel" unless they add specific meaning.
- Prefer neutral labels like "research question", "people", "pain points", "techniques", and "references".
- Scope novelty claims precisely and hedge when needed.

